sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Admin / Viewer
    participant API as git-logs/v2 API
    participant AZ as Authorizer
    participant DB as SQLite Root DB
    participant AUD as AuditTrail

    Note over U,API: GET /get-logs (body or ?q=)
    U->>API: WP App Password / cookie + body { RepoUrl, GitSha256 }
    API->>AZ: resolve WP user -> Profile -> Permission(HistoryView)
    alt Permitted
        API->>DB: join RepoVersion+Pipeline+LogEntry+ErrorLogEntry by GitSha256
        DB-->>API: rows
        API-->>U: { RepoUrl, RootRepo, BranchName, PipelineNames[], IsPass, HasError, ErrorLogs[], Logs[] }
        API->>AUD: LogQuery Success
    else Denied
        API->>AUD: AuthFail / Rejected
        API-->>U: 401/403 GL-AUTHZ-PERMISSION-DENIED
    end

    Note over U,API: GET /get-pipeline-logs (body or ?q=)
    U->>API: { RepoUrl, GitSha256, PipelineName }
    API->>DB: scoped to one Pipeline
    API-->>U: { ..., PipelineName, IsPass, HasError, ErrorLogs[], Logs[] }

    Note over U,API: GET /get-error-logs
    U->>API: { RepoUrl, GitSha256 }
    API->>DB: ErrorLogEntry only, all pipelines
    API-->>U: { ..., PipelineNames[], IsPass, HasError, ErrorLogs[{PipelineName, LogText}] }

    Note over U,API: GET /get-pipeline-error-logs
    U->>API: { RepoUrl, GitSha256, PipelineName }
    API->>DB: ErrorLogEntry for one Pipeline
    API-->>U: { ..., PipelineName, IsPass, HasError, ErrorLogs[] }
